OBSERVED GAP
FG-05 proves the protocol components compose correctly.

FG-06 proves:

* clean wheel installation;
* `saimail-local`;
* stable API map;
* utility under specific workloads.

But the currently demonstrated workflow remains synthetic/ephemeral.

A real local operator still lacks one minimal persistent workflow for actual local send/receive across separate invocations.

V2-01 closes exactly that gap.

